 self expression\n\nEcstatic dance is all about flowing mind\, body\, and s
 oul.\nTogether in this judgement free space. We’ll help guide you into c
 onnection with your body through somatic exercises. Then we will move our 
 bodies to a playlist created to help us tap into our intuitive energetic f
 low\n\n*Donation based*
